## Harness wall time

I can't give a figure for Qwen3-0.6B, because I could not run it. These are for the synthetic 3-layer, 64-wide model with 8 tokens on this machine (16 CPUs, torch using 12 threads). They show the harness works and are not a measure of the real model.

| Run | Build and load | Decode |
|---|---|---|
| f32 | 0.80 s (includes first-call warm-up) | 0.007 s |
| f64 (unpatched) | 0.006 s | 0.007 s |
| f64 (native) | 0.005 s | 0.006 s |

